# corpus/ is collated from sources.md by the kit's local script. We commit
# the collated copies because the splash (CI build → GitHub Pages) reads
# from ../corpus and the source repos aren't present in the CI checkout.
# Re-run the collator locally and commit the diff when sources change.
corpus/.chroma/

